<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan starts data storage stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan starts data storage stocks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of several data storage stocks.</p>
<p>-- rated Adaptec Inc, Western Digital Corp, Quantum Corp, EMC Corp and Seagate Technology Inc with outperform ratings.</p>
<p>-- rated StorMedia Inc neutral.</p>
